## 6-PHASE WORKFLOW

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> P0: Start
    P0 --> P1: Inventory complete
    P1 --> P2: Orchestrations documented
    P2 --> P3: Schemas & Maps documented
    P3 --> P4: Pipelines, Ports & Helpers documented
    P4 --> P5: Replication-readiness assessed
    P5 --> [*]: Zero data loss certified
```

| Phase | Name | Scope | Deliverable |
|-------|------|-------|-------------|
| **0** | Discovery & Inventory | Scan app, classify & count ALL artifacts, build reading plan + assembly-reference graph | Sections 1-2, `artifact-inventory.md` |
| **1** | Orchestration Documentation | Per-`.odx` RGV: shapes, ports, messages, variables, correlations, filters, inline expressions | Section 3, `orchestration-flows.md` |
| **2** | Schema & Map Documentation | Per-`.xsd` structure + per-map RGV: ALL field links (functoids/`.xsl`) | Section 4, `schema-structures.md`, `map-mappings.md` |
| **3** | Pipeline, Port & Helper Documentation | Per-`.btp` stages/components + per-`.cs` helper logic + assembly references | Section 5, `pipeline-helper-reference.md` |
| **4** | Replication-Readiness & Gap Assessment | BizTalk→MuleSoft mapping + ambiguity/missing-dependency flags | Section 6, `replication-gap-report.md` |
| **5** | Validation & Certification | File-by-file reconciliation, coverage + zero-data-loss certification | Section 7, `verification-checklist.md` |

**Processing:** Continuous with count-verified micro-checkpoints per section (no user stops between phases).

