## OUTPUT STRUCTURE

```
project/output_biztalk/{app_name}/
├── biztalk_design_{app_name}.md            # Main document (7 sections)
├── supporting-docs/
│   ├── artifact-inventory.md               # Phase 0: all artifacts + counts + assembly-ref graph
│   ├── orchestration-flows.md              # Phase 1: ALL orchestration shapes/ports/expressions
│   ├── schema-structures.md                # Phase 2: ALL schema field trees
│   ├── map-mappings.md                     # Phase 2: ALL map links (source→target + functoid logic)
│   ├── pipeline-helper-reference.md        # Phase 3: pipelines + .cs helper logic + assembly refs
│   ├── replication-gap-report.md           # Phase 4: BizTalk→MuleSoft map + gap flags
│   └── verification-checklist.md           # Phase 5: counts, reconciliation, certification
└── .biztalk-state.json                     # State for resume (6 phases)
```

**Naming:** `{app_name}` from the BizTalk application/solution name (e.g., `VenMYEInvoice`, `VenHPEdi._824`).

